OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill be dry. Then the rest of the
OL,7,Fnight be largely dry with variable
OL,8,Famounts of cloud. Chance of a few
OL,9,Fshowers later in the southwest.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSunday:FCloudy with outbreaks of light
OL,12,Fand patchy rain and drizzle, best of
OL,13,Fany bright weather for north
OL,14,FAberdeenshire. Chance of a heavier
OL,15,Fshower in the afternoon.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FA few
OL,18,Fshowers on Monday. Rain spreading east
OL,19,Fon Tuesday morning followed by
OL,20,Fshowers. Rain spreading northeast on
OL,21,FWednesday.
